OL,3,GNEWSASara Sharif's grandfather granted
OL,4,Aguardianship of her siblings in
OL,5,APakistan
OL,6,
OL,7,FAll five children, who are now aged
OL,8,Fbetween 16 and four, have been living
OL,9,Fin Pakistan since 2023. They were asked
OL,10,Fto speak to the judge in court, where
OL,11,Fthe eldest said they were comfortable
OL,12,Fand the siblings were settled.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
